<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine bolsa's MerVal adds one stock.</title>
<headline>Argentine bolsa's MerVal adds one stock.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's weighted MerVal stock index added one stock Tuesday in its quarterly revision based on volumes traded, the Argentine bolsa said.</p>
<p>The new stock on the roster is steelmaker Siderar, making a total of 29 MerVal issues, as follows:  </p>
<p>Acindar</p>
<p>Alpargatas</p>
<p>Astra</p>
<p>Banco Frances</p>
<p>Banco de Galicia</p>
<p>Banco del Sud</p>
<p>Capex</p>
<p>Celulosa</p>
<p>Central Costanera</p>
<p>Central Puerto</p>
<p>Ciadea  </p>
<p>Comercial del Plata</p>
<p>Cresud</p>
<p>Indupa</p>
<p>Ipako</p>
<p>Irsa</p>
<p>Juan Minetti</p>
<p>Ledesma</p>
<p>Molinos Rio de la Plata</p>
<p>Telecom</p>
<p>Telefnica</p>
<p>Transportadora de Gas del Sur  </p>
<p>Perez Companc</p>
<p>Polledo</p>
<p>Sevel</p>
<p>Siderar</p>
<p>Siderca</p>
<p>Sol Petroleo</p>
<p>YPF</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0657</p>
